  unitName: Purifying Flame Rugahr
  unitId: 11046
  unitNumber: 1569
  description: A warrior of lava and a member of the fearsome group known as the
    Ten Vile Disnomians, who were active during the dawn of the empire. A man of
    logic and reasoning, Rugahr rarely hesitated to use any means available to achieve
    his goals. However, he never left his comrades behind, and they loved him well
    for this. When the Imperial Guard ambushed the Disnomians, he bought time for
    his friends to escape by using the fire burning within him to blow himself up
    along with a great number of the imperial force.
  summonDesc: You want to be my friend?<br>Fine, then I'll protect you.<br>Friends
    are...everything to me.
  fusionDesc: There is no clean path to victory.<br>If you lose, you lose it all...<br>That's
    the reality I live in.
